values={{"01M4V5T7GQHDANHX6YWRT7VHD5": {"kind": "string", "value": "Hello\n\nThank you for getting a copy of this community file for Adobe's Spectrum Design System. In this file, you'll find a range of components and assets that can be easily customized to suit your needs. External links to guidelines and other documentation have also been included to help you discover additional details and implementations. Whether you're working on a web application, mobile app, or another project, this file can provide a solid foundation for creating beautiful, consistent designs.\n\nI hope this file serves as a valuable tool for your design work and helps you create amazing digital experiences.\n\nHappy designing!"}, "01M4V5T7GQRZVAGDYWYTAP8699": {"kind": "string", "value": "Platform Scale"}}} x={96.0} y={96.0} />
